<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Banco de Mexico said on Friday it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The central bank said it will also auction one- and two- year Bondes.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  18.05 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  19.74 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     800 million pesos  19.62 pct</p>
<p>    364 days     600 million pesos  18.74 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    364 days     500 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>    728 days     700 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-7902))</p>
</text>
